    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>越过山丘！放弃秋季高考，转战DIY留学申请之路，虽然坎坷，但一切源于热爱！</span></p><p><span>从2/5到4/18，每一天都在战斗</span></p><p><span>2/5-3/20 全力备考雅思。</span></p><p><span>集龙珠的3月</span></p><p><span>简历，动机信，雅思成绩，学校成绩单，在读证明，（翻译，公证）护照首页，作品集</span></p><p><span>不平等条约的签署，终于获得在读证明和成绩单。</span></p><p><span>3/23-4/18 全力准备面试</span></p><p><span>4/4 集齐龙珠完成网上申请</span></p><p><span>4/13 一场特殊的面谈</span></p><p><span>4/18 面试当天的失误</span></p><p><span>4/29 凌晨一封让全家失眠的邮件</span></p><p><span>片尾歌曲: 拝啓十五の君へ</span></p><p><span>放一些儿子做过的好吃的</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvcfj8G9ioKoLinzfqvZBbvaRUoJ.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsiZetwAmZvnX67OBhJH6h9SRbAt.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn_VIpU7VAdoJh98OU8GxKDoXSLV.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh8OrbqBsLG9mnixRZvvcq4bwUWR.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fml_-NzzLarJIMPo5e4aUXDa9WBf.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FljPvAywXwsM-22jZq2sWZQHhqh3.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn2Ti2sLd8ILJUKk_khHE2D66K-d.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnG1A5QThXgfk0q0Xw1seCd5Ky9f.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flx0qeh0H3ZLWOq3O4HEPeCbs9J_.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
